# DEFECT: when the (re)created resampler fails, obs_source_output_audio returns from process_audio early but still
# pushes source->audio_data (the PREVIOUS successfully processed packet, or an empty one) into the buffer.
# Here a good packet is followed by a packet whose format needs a resampler that cannot be created:
# the old packet is stored again at the new timestamp.
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
source a input
output a 48000 2 480 1000000000 const 0.5
state a
resampler 0 1
output a 44100 2 441 1010000000 const 0.9
state a
